      <div class="group-right right-side">
      <div class="field field-name-comment-body field-type-text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even" property="content:encoded"><p>I used your goblin in a top-down Link to the Past type game. I just uploaded an update to itch.io. If you would like to check it out here is the link: <a href="https://dansena.itch.io/cronicles-of-liberia-the-legend-of-sara">https://dansena.itch.io/cronicles-of-liberia-the-legend-of-sara</a></p>
